    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the silence is heavy. it... it almost feels like a pull. like the emptiness itself wants me to just join it. the sword is so cold, but it's the only thing that feels real anymore. if the story is already over, why keep dragging out the epilogue? it just feels like hurting more every second.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
